{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122812","id":4360327985,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA-VTMQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122812","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122812.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122812.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122812","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122812/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122812/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122812/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1f2d8cbc43e37f4c576424905f4206c742a3c134","number":122812,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix documentation tooltips closing on false mouse exit","user":{"login":"Jaydeng75","id":133883890,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_rn8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133883890?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaydeng75","html_url":"https://github.com/Jaydeng75","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaydeng75/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaydeng75/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaydeng75/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaydeng75/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaydeng75/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaydeng75/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaydeng75/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaydeng75/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jaydeng75/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes #122770.\r\n\r\nDocumentation tooltips can receive `mouse_exited` from their target as the tooltip window is shown even while the cursor is still over that target. The resulting 250 ms dismissal timer makes the tooltip disappear before it can be read or entered.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nBefore starting the dismissal timer, the tooltip now checks the current cursor position against the target screen rectangle. Shortcut-triggered tooltips retain their existing behavior. The patch adds no persistent state.\r\n\r\nA regression test uses the mock display server to verify both sides of the behavior: a false exit while the cursor remains over the target does not start the timer, while moving outside the target does.\r\n\r\nValidation performed:\r\n\r\n- Built the Windows editor with tests enabled.\r\n- Ran the focused `EditorHelpBitTooltip` test: 1 test case and 2 assertions passed.\r\n- Verified tooltip persistence and dismissal interactively in both the Inspector and Editor Settings.\r\n- Tested rapid target/tooltip crossings, adjacent properties/settings, entering the tooltip itself, and five repeated trigger/dismiss cycles in each location.\r\n- Confirmed the regression test fails with the old dismissal behavior and passes with this fix.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-25T18:01:48Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T18:23:01Z","closed_at":"2026-08-25T18:19:15Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"46092677b858a52236f2e307f7f26a71638dc3a0","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Jaydeng75:fix-documentation-tooltip-false-exit","ref":"fix-documentation-tooltip-false-exit","repo":{"id":1346461835,"node_id":"R_kgDOUEFgiw","name":"godot","full_name":"Jayd